{"ticker":"CBOE","updated":"2026-11-13T22:51:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Cboe Global Markets, Inc.","shortName":"Cboe Global Markets, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cboe.com","fullTimeEmployees":1661,"marketCap":39167655936,"trailingPE":26.720285,"forwardPE":24.224209,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.4203653,"pegRatio":3.27,"targetMeanPrice":355.6,"targetHighPrice":461.0,"targetLowPrice":299.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.19,"earningsGrowth":0.432,"grossMargins":0.53876,"operatingMargins":0.36426,"profitMargins":0.28048,"totalRevenue":5278400000,"beta":0.362,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":378.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":227.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"BTS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.93},"summary":"Cboe Global Markets, Inc., through its subsidiaries, operates as a derivatives and securities exchange network that delivers trading, clearing, and investment solutions in the United States and internationally. It operates through five segments: Options, North American Equities, Europe and Asia Pacific, Futures, and Global FX. The Options segment includes options on market indices, stocks of individual corporations, and exchange-traded products (ETPs), such as exchange-traded funds (ETFs) and exchange-traded notes (ETNs). This segment also offers trading in listed options through a single system. The North American Equities segment comprises U.S. equities and ETP transaction services. This segment also includes listing services on Cboe Canada, ETP listings on BZX, the Cboe Global Markets, Inc. common stock listing, and applicable market data. The Europe and Asia Pacific segment provides pan-European derivatives transaction services; ETPs, including exchange-traded funds, exchange-traded notes, and exchange-traded commodities; international depository receipts; and an ETP listings business on regulated markets and clearing activities, as well as equities services. The Futures segment offers transaction services, including trading in VIX futures and other futures products, the licensing of proprietary market data, and access and capacity services. The Global FX segment provides i","summary_zh":"Cboe Global Markets, Inc. 透過其子公司，作為衍生性商品和證券交易網路運營，在美國和國際上提供交易、清算和投資解決方案。該公司透過五個部門運作：選擇權部門、北美股票部門、歐洲和亞太地區部門、期貨部門以及全球外匯部門。選擇權部分包括市場指數選擇權、個別公司股票和交易所交易產品（ETP），例如交易所交易基金（ETF）和交易所交易票據（ETN）。該部門也透過單一系統提供上市選擇權交易。北美股票部門包括美國股票和 ETP 交易服務。該部門還包括 Cboe Canada 的上市服務、BZX 的 ETP 上市、Cboe Global Markets, Inc. 普通股上市以及適用的市場數據。歐洲和亞太分部提供泛歐衍生性商品交易服務； ETP，包括交易所交易基金、交易所交易票據和交易所交易商品；國際存託憑證；以及受監管市場和清算活動的 ETP 上市業務以及股票服務。期貨部門提供交易服務，包括 VIX 期貨和其他期貨產品的交易、專有市場數據的許可以及存取和容量服務。全球外匯部門提供 i","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":233.43,"h":238.8,"l":233.28,"c":234.09,"v":1137000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":233.11,"h":237.76,"l":232.37,"c":233.74,"v":855500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":233.86,"h":237.12,"l":232.58,"c":236.96,"v":606100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":236.67,"h":237.28,"l":233.0,"c":234.43,"v":936400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":231.69,"h":235.13,"l":231.38,"c":233.06,"v":982900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":235.0,"h":237.98,"l":233.65,"c":236.62,"v":840100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":236.99,"h":240.52,"l":234.85,"c":240.32,"v":1151000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":240.06,"h":243.31,"l":238.0,"c":243.19,"v":959100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":243.17,"h":245.89,"l":239.2,"c":243.99,"v":1124800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":246.02,"h":246.94,"l":243.5,"c":243.52,"v":617700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":244.07,"h":247.57,"l":242.2,"c":246.24,"v":834500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":247.62,"h":248.99,"l":244.23,"c":245.25,"v":840500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":245.0,"h":245.45,"l":239.33,"c":241.57,"v":806900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":241.82,"h":242.99,"l":239.09,"c":241.49,"v":676600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":241.3,"h":242.25,"l":239.1,"c":239.54,"v":637300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":238.57,"h":239.76,"l":234.72,"c":236.84,"v":859400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":237.66,"h":240.9,"l":236